te=\"57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" href=\"?note=57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrderKatetovOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrderKatetovOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}katetov\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrderKatetovOrder}_S(\\mathcal{I},\\mathcal{J},X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(Y,\\mathcal J)\\land\\exists f:Y\\to X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{I}\\;(f^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal{J})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}katetov\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrderKatetovOrder}_S(\\mathcal{I},\\mathcal{J},X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(Y,\\mathcal J)\\land\\exists f:Y\\to X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{I}\\;(f^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal{J})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first ideal is Katětov below the second; the witnessing map pulls every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>-small set back to a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J\">\\(\\mathcal J\\)</span>-small set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":fal